Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
---------------------------------------------------------
Applies to observational data collected by the ARCTERX 2023 Wake programme
and to derived products in this repository:

  data/pressure/    bottom-pressure gauges (12 sites), decimated
  data/adcp/        C05 RDI Workhorse, depth-averaged
  data/drifters/    mwb GPS timeseries regenerated from the raw instrument
                    records by src/mwb_nc.py
  data/raw_dat/     raw mwb .dat burst files
  data/eddy_kinematics.npz

  Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
  Cite as: ARCTERX 2023 Wake experiment, Peleliu tip. Coastal Observing
  Research and Development Center, Scripps Institution of Oceanography.

Third-party data — NOT covered by the above
-------------------------------------------
  data/bathy/angaur_peleliu_crop.nc
      Bathymetry by the **Coral Reef Research Foundation (CRRF)**, Koror,
      Palau -- https://coralreefpalau.org/
      Cropped from Angaur_Peleliu_25m.nc. Attribute CRRF in any figure or
      result that depends on it, and contact them for terms of use before
      redistributing the grid.

Not included, deliberately
--------------------------
  data/cordc_delivered/
      The CORDC-delivered NetCDF files are NOT redistributed here. They are
      only needed as ground truth for tests/test_mwb_dat.py, which skips
      cleanly without them. Point it at your own copy:
          python3 tests/test_mwb_dat.py <raw_dat_dir> <delivered.nc>


  papers/*.pdf
      Journal articles are copyrighted by their publishers and are NOT
      redistributed here. papers/README.md carries the full citations and
      DOIs, and papers/fetch_papers.sh retrieves them from a machine with
      institutional access. See papers/.gitignore.
